{
  "gui.guhs.kleding.prijs.hint.in_badhuis_de_warme_knabbel": "In the chests of the Warm Nibble bathhouse, under the wool",
  "gui.guhs.kledingbron.loot_badhuis": "The Warm Nibble Bathhouse",
  "item.guhs.handdoek_tulband": "Towel Turban",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_badmeester.1": "Njeg! No diving into the cold bath!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_badmeester.2": "Rinse first, then vads. That's how we do it at The Warm Nibble.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_badmeester.3": "Bubbles are free. Foam too. My whistle isn't.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_badmeester.4": "No running by the bath! Vadsing is fine. Lots of vadsing.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_barguh.1": "Strawberry, mint or choco? Vahoeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_barguh.2": "A cheese shake costs three nibbles. The straw is free.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_barguh.3": "A cold shake after the warm bath. That's how the old Roman guhs did it.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_barguh.4": "Cheese in your shake? Of course. Everything is better with cheese.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bouwploeg.1": "We were on our way to a job. Three years ago. Left was right, wasn't it?",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bouwploeg.2": "We'll finish that tunnel, don't worry. A little break first. Three years now.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bouwploeg.3": "Take some stones with you. Then we don't have to lug them back.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_bouwploeg.4": "The crane works fine. It's just having a nap, like Henk.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_fossiel.1": "Look at those little ears! A real ancient guh.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_fossiel.2": "There was still a cheese nibble in its tummy! A fossil nibble. Don't eat it.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_fossiel.3": "I've been digging here for twenty years. With a teaspoon. It's going well.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_fossiel.4": "I think it just lay there vadsing for a very long time. A very, very long time.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_grotguh.1": "Welcome to our burrows! We're Cave Guhs. We sparkle in the dark, njeg.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_grotguh.2": "Every little burrow has a nest, a cushion and a lamp. A guh needs nothing more.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_grotguh.3": "The sun? Never heard of it. We have crystals. They're warm too. A little.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_grotguh.4": "Take a nibble from the stash. Just one. I'm counting them, mind you.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_huisje.1": "I was only taking a nap... and then I lived underground.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_huisje.2": "My neighbours still live upstairs. Sometimes I wave at the ceiling.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_huisje.3": "The house is still sinking a little. One paw a day. Cosy, right?",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_huisje.4": "The post never comes down here. Nice and quiet though, njeg.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kaas.1": "Njeg! We make ALL the sauce here.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kaas.2": "Pump, stir, vads... and done!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kaas.3": "Old? Not at all. The cheese is old. The dairy is brand new.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kaas.4": "Tasting is allowed, but only with a nibble. Without a nibble it's just slurping.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kweker.1": "A sip and a song every morning. That's how they grow fastest. Njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kweker.2": "Don't touch, please, they're still growing. And they're very shy.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kweker.3": "This one is only four weeks old. Look at it sparkle!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_kweker.4": "If you're very quiet, you can hear them grow. Pling. Pling.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_station.1": "Welcome to Diepewol Station! The next sled leaves... some day.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_station.2": "A ticket? One nibble. Where to? Nowhere, the track caved in. Njeg.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_station.3": "Sleds full of cheese nibbles used to ride here. Now only the dust rides along.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_station.4": "I've been selling tickets for thirty years. Never sold a single one. Maybe tomorrow!",
